{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7001_p", "source_sha256": "8095abe00c45074aadb014d971518a5d1a0df771f8d94cf685bd3c8c72f418da", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n茜のテーマは『スライム界のスーパーアイドル』だ！）", "zh": "（今天是《偶像写真！！》杂志的拍摄日。\n茜的主题是“史莱姆界的超级偶像”！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7002_023aka", "source_sha256": "e38f699c4424263774c8a9627c12ff646a93f57cae44d40451201a95b90f6e1c", "ja": "ふっふっふ……今回のテーマは楽勝楽勝～！\nだって、こーんなにかわいいスライムだからね☆", "zh": "呵呵呵……这次的主题简简单单～！\n因为人家可是这么可爱的史莱姆哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7003_p", "source_sha256": "6794c7a03d0aca7b5c3e09b0c3025b95249a128e6917b46ba5976b0dc860bcf8", "ja": "そうだな。確かに似合ってる。\nけど、スライム界はそんなに甘くないと思うぞ？", "zh": "是啊，确实很适合。可是，我觉得史莱姆界可没那么好混吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7004_023aka", "source_sha256": "b8c9cfc4d806badab382ec2ee043ef98000092dd96f3f0c376f96ef238ab97b2", "ja": "ニャニャ！？　予想外のツッコミ……。うーん、\n{$P$}ちゃんは厳しいね……。", "zh": "喵喵！？这吐槽真是出乎意料……嗯——\n{$P$}真严格啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7005_023aka", "source_sha256": "5b0c0d0c5439f2f9a0fe29113d512cb0530c91f065f765fba969592c38a2bab5", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、茜ちゃんがスーパースライム\nアイドルになるのに、何が足りないのか教えてよ～！", "zh": "那那，告诉我，小茜要成为超级史莱姆偶像，还缺什么嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7007", "source_sha256": "9205d7661a5954b1789b0bc3941670c963778a98dfb4ae343db510381d60fb93", "ja": "アクション！", "zh": "行动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7008", "source_sha256": "aa2664791db8a0b7cbde5f85c0edc213f4aa27992cc9c336d3670b832983d3b2", "ja": "分裂！", "zh": "分裂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7200_p", "source_sha256": "6053a6de5b45e896efe2fc4c71ce3f9cca569b374a9b2a5f918cfd6da0805f62", "ja": "スライムのイメージ的に、元気よく動いてた方が\n魅力的に見えるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "从史莱姆的形象来看，活力十足地动起来\n会不会显得更有魅力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7201_023aka", "source_sha256": "7264ce9e71dea6e12996a53b1c5cb9f46a2ec5a86982e6ea572299ab292af4c8", "ja": "それなら茜ちゃんに任せてよ！\n元気すぎて、写真から飛び出ちゃうかも♪", "zh": "那就交给小茜吧！\n说不定会活泼过头，直接从照片里跳出来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7202_023aka", "source_sha256": "96d66d18a612dc4d2a895a5bb4e894cee01de4d7e43cd34ed42cb6f94af79c1e", "ja": "カメラに向かって……元気にジャーンプ！　ってね。\n躍動する茜ちゃんから、もう目が離せない……っ！", "zh": "对着镜头……活力满满地——跳！就是这样。  \n从跃动的小茜身上，已经移不开视线了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7300_p", "source_sha256": "6053a6de5b45e896efe2fc4c71ce3f9cca569b374a9b2a5f918cfd6da0805f62", "ja": "スライムのイメージ的に、元気よく動いてた方が\n魅力的に見えるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "从史莱姆的形象来看，活力十足地动起来\n会不会显得更有魅力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7301_023aka", "source_sha256": "2e6a8880f9f8283062c47462ebc3f21283401aa879d21ab697b1d429e9487fa9", "ja": "元気に動く子は、かわいがりたくなるよね～。\nうんうん。茜ちゃんも、よく言われます。", "zh": "活泼好动的孩子，会让人忍不住想疼爱，对吧～。\n嗯嗯，小茜也经常被这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7302_023aka", "source_sha256": "4da9e5b86402a28ba10b07b57a4d2bcd4debd706f32e7da5983d01295f6d1b9d", "ja": "それじゃ、今から元気いっぱいに動くから、\n{$P$}ちゃんもかわいがってね♪", "zh": "那我现在就活力满满地动起来，{$P$}也要好好宠爱我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7500_p", "source_sha256": "8c7089acb49206c5d0da93783c3ef7ee0594ac5f8090841efb2ba47181f46b31", "ja": "スライムは分裂するような柔らかさがあるし、\nそういう特徴を活かすのはどうだ？", "zh": "史莱姆有种能够分裂的柔软感，\n活用这种特征怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7501_023aka", "source_sha256": "3dabe451558a5688d9d9df7e2cd165cc00fa678a34e1a2a8128628d6d9d9ffa5", "ja": "つまり……スーパーカワイイ茜ちゃんが、無限増殖って\nこと！？　さすが{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "也就是说……超级可爱的小茜要无限增殖了！？不愧是{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7502_023aka", "source_sha256": "4468ae51d5303f8300da4f0c759ad173c7b3e7c5fecff6566d2b8d3bfd369eee", "ja": "スライム茜ちゃんが、かわいさの大渋滞！\nそれじゃ分裂してみるね！　むむむ～っ……。", "zh": "史莱姆小茜，可爱得大堵车啦！那我就试着分裂一下吧！唔唔唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7600_p", "source_sha256": "8c7089acb49206c5d0da93783c3ef7ee0594ac5f8090841efb2ba47181f46b31", "ja": "スライムは分裂するような柔らかさがあるし、\nそういう特徴を活かすのはどうだ？", "zh": "史莱姆有种能够分裂的柔软感，\n活用这种特征怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7601_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d9a958f9d5f3d09f8b7e13aadb845fcfe9c2fba2dc1c5a6f2edc5cc0a748438", "ja": "ふむふむ、『数は力』ってことだね。いくら茜ちゃんが\n天才といっても分裂は……んにゃ？　んにゃにゃ～？", "zh": "嗯嗯，也就是说，“数量就是力量”吧。就算小茜是天才，分裂也……嗯喵？嗯喵喵～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_7602_023aka", "source_sha256": "472b797979f3465a69e96be84712fa78a8fef6a3d068d8f9b4f6b47e54049e49", "ja": "スライム茜ちゃん人形を並べればよくない！？\n{$P$}ちゃん、急いで用意するよ！", "zh": "把史莱姆小茜人偶摆起来不就行了吗！？\n{$P$}，我马上准备好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
